  "description": "There is a couple who promised to marry on their very first blind date?! The clueless Potato meets the man who does everything in practice. Can people really be this different? A chaotic marriage story filled with life's ups and downs, unfolding as a man and woman from different worlds meet! Today, Potato and the Handsome Man present another happy and tearful wedding cartoon about married life!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
